    "created_at": "2025-05-27T19:54:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-27T19:54:52Z",
    "body": "Yes, please file a Chromium issue to track making the behavior consistent between platforms. Then let's use this issue to track adding a note to the specification clarifying that the specified ordering is important.",
